vigilkit plugin-mqtt

This product includes software developed by vigilkit contributors
(https://github.com/SnowCrescenter-tech/vigilkit). This package is licensed
under the Apache License 2.0; see LICENSE.

The MQTT 3.1.1 protocol (packet formats, flag layouts, and the QoS 0/1/2
delivery semantics) is implemented from the OASIS public specification
"MQTT Version 3.1.1" (OASIS Standard, 29 October 2014). No third-party MQTT
implementation, SDK binary, or source code is vendored, copied, or linked
into this package; it has zero runtime dependencies. WebSocket transport is
provided by the host runtime's native WebSocket API.

The Apache-2.0 license applies only to the code written by vigilkit
contributors; it does not apply to the MQTT specification itself or to any
broker software this client may connect to.
